# DUSKLING R8, THE ROSE NEST (room 36): the rose nest: up the mound to the egg.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder.
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 36
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 21
wait 2
expect state == 4
expect egg_got == 2
